    "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n\t<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Agenda Overview</h2>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How are tracks organized each day?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Each day groups sessions under parallel tracks so attendees can follow a single theme or mix disciplines. Tracks run in dedicated rooms with staggered breaks to prevent hallway crowding.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I preview session timing before registering?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes, the full timeline shows start and end times for every keynote, workshop, and networking block. Hover any session to see its speaker and format without leaving the page.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When do breaks and meals appear?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Review every session, keynote, and break across all tracks in one unified timeline. Spot scheduling conflicts early and fine-tune the flow before doors open.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Are session details expandable?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every session card expands to show the abstract, speaker bios, and room capacity. Collapse all tracks at once to compare high-level flow across the entire conference.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
